# JARVIS keys — copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env.
#
#   cp .env.example .env && chmod 600 .env
#
# The server reads these. None of them ever reach the browser: the page posts
# text/audio to the server, and the server holds the keys.

# --- Data mode -------------------------------------------------------------
# 1 = invented demo fixtures (default, safe to screen-record)
# 0 = your real folders (edit REAL_FOLDERS in agent/data.py first)
JARVIS_DEMO=1

# --- Voice (ElevenLabs) — PAID. Leave blank to run without voice. ----------
# With no key, text still works and the UI says voice is off. Setting a key is
# your opt-in to spend (see the cost note in README.md).
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# Optional: pick a voice and models (sensible defaults if omitted).
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=21m00Tcm4TlvDq8ikWAM
# ELEVENLABS_TTS_MODEL=eleven_turbo_v2_5

# --- Model (optional) — PAID. Leave blank to run model-free. ---------------
# With no key, routing falls back to file-scoring and a badge says so. With a
# key, the model phrases spoken lines in your tone (CLAUDE.md).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# JARVIS_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# --- Server ----------------------------------------------------------------
# JARVIS_PORT=8765
